{"name":"September Morning","hex":"#ffe9bb","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"morning","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The early part of the day, especially from midnight to noon. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The early part of anything."]},{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Ellipsis of good morning."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/morning"}],"entries":[{"title":"September Mourning","blocks":[{"text":"September Mourning is an American alternative metal band that incorporates a transmedia dark culture project created by Emily Lazar and Marc Silvestri. The conceptual project was formed by frontwoman, vocalist, and screamer Emily Lazar in New York in 2009. The concept narrative created by Lazar and incorporated in the band and their performances, centers around the fictional story of a human-grim reaper hybrid named September, as she navigates the worlds of the living and the dead. The character's human-side possesses the empathy to give some human souls a second chance. The story is presented on different media platforms, including music, comic books, and live concerts. The comic books are published by Top Cow Productions Image Comics."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/September_Mourning","wikidata":"Q7452230"},{"title":"September","blocks":[{"text":"September is the ninth month of the year in the Julian and Gregorian calendars. Its length is 30 days."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Les_Tr%C3%A8s_Riches_Heures_du_duc_de_Berry_septembre.jpg/330px-Les_Tr%C3%A8s_Riches_Heures_du_duc_de_Berry_septembre.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/September","wikidata":"Q123"},{"title":"Morning","blocks":[{"text":"Morning is either the period from sunrise to noon, or the period from midnight to noon. In the first definition it is preceded by the twilight period of dawn, and there are no exact times for when morning begins because it can vary according to one's latitude, and the hours of daytime at each time of year. However, morning strictly ends at noon, when afternoon starts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Morning%2C_just_after_sunrise%2C_Namibia.jpg/330px-Morning%2C_just_after_sunrise%2C_Namibia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morning","wikidata":"Q7722"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Sapphire_ring.jpg/500px-Sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Sapphire_ring.jpg/1280px-Sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Sapphire_ring.jpg/500px-Sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sapphire, a birthstone of September ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASapphire_ring.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg/500px-2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg/1280px-2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg/500px-2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Forget-me-not, the birth flower of September","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2008-05-04_at_18-26-44-Forgetmenot-Flower.jpg"},{"